Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Review: the sliver warning's parallel claims are tested;
 the fill dump is written only where asked

- tests/parallel/test_0907 (np 2, the outcrop's surgery on rank 1): the
  recorded angle is the same on every rank, below 180, and the warning is
  printed on rank 0 only. test_0907 is marked serial-only; its assertions
  read one rank's mesh.
- A refused fill wrote place_fill_failure_rank<r>.npz into the user's working
  directory. It is now written only into a directory named by
  UW_PLACE_FILL_DUMP, and the message says how to ask for it.

